    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17988680314699776
    m_Localized: Erratic Mosaic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17988680314699777
    m_Localized: "Chain combos different from the last one: the 2nd pays +4 damage,
      the 3rd +6, the 4th +8\u2026 Repeating the last one resets the chain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17988681023537152
    m_Localized: Waning Echo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17988681023537153
    m_Localized: Your attack damage starts at x3 when you pick it up. Every combo
      you play lowers it by 0.2; at x1 the item breaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17988681744957440
    m_Localized: Skipped Beat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17988681744957441
    m_Localized: 'Your Straights also count when skipping one number: 3-5-7-9-11
      or 2-4-6-8-10.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
