  - m_Id: 18278206953848832
    m_Localized: Artillery Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206974820352
    m_Localized: 'Embers from the Artillery''s shell: burns hard on impact and keeps
      burning each turn standing on it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208960
    m_Localized: Artillery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208961
    m_Localized: 'House howitzer: shells from afar and leaves the floor burning where
      the shot lands.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208962
    m_Localized: Charger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208963
    m_Localized: Lines up, marks the lane and charges. Don't stand in its path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208964
    m_Localized: Guardian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208965
    m_Localized: 'Shields its own: nearby allies take less damage while it stands.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208966
    m_Localized: Skirmisher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208967
    m_Localized: 'Restless shooter: fires from range and slips away diagonally so
      you can''t corner it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208968
    m_Localized: Sniper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208969
    m_Localized: Fires from across the room. Break its line of sight or pay for the
      shot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208970
    m_Localized: Sweeper Card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208971
    m_Localized: 'House soldier that marks a sweep: its blow covers several tiles
      at once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208972
    m_Localized: The One-Armed Bandit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208973
    m_Localized: 'A three-reel slot machine bolted to the wall. It never chases you:
      it counts to the jackpot. Break any reel to cancel the count.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208974
    m_Localized: Reel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208975
    m_Localized: "One of La Bandida's three reels. Any hit cancels the jackpot count,
      but breaking one costs most of a turn \u2014 and the tile it leaves behind
      burns."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208976
    m_Localized: The Scorekeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208977
    m_Localized: "The one who keeps the sheet. He doesn't play against you: he corrects
      your score as you roll \u2014 and never in your favor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208978
    m_Localized: The Cardsharp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18278206983208979
    m_Localized: "The bank calls your hand before you play it. Building it exactly
      pays out; overshooting is greed \u2014 and the pot keeps count of greed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17321473286172672
    m_Localized: Heart of Fortune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17321473286172673
    m_Localized: Recover 5 HP for each unused roll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17285590277255168
    m_Localized: Climber's Gloves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17285590277255169
    m_Localized: The Straight deals +25 damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679601246208
    m_Localized: Second Chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679638994944
    m_Localized: When you attack, +1.5 to the multiplier for each unused roll you
      still have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966464
    m_Localized: Dice in Reserve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966465
    m_Localized: When you attack, +2 to the multiplier for each rolled die you did
      not hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966466
    m_Localized: Keystone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966467
    m_Localized: The first combo of each combat adds +2 to the multiplier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966468
    m_Localized: Magic Fountain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966469
    m_Localized: The highest die in your combo leaves base damage and adds its face
      to the multiplier. Doesn't apply to Higher Number.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966470
    m_Localized: Vertigo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966471
    m_Localized: Each combo in the combat adds +0.05 to the multiplier. A Pair resets
      it to 0.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966472
    m_Localized: Odd Purse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966473
    m_Localized: +3 gold for each odd die that is part of the combo you play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966474
    m_Localized: Fasting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18299679659966475
    m_Localized: You receive no healing from passive items. In exchange, all your
      combo multipliers get +3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491544969216
    m_Localized: Vampire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106560
    m_Localized: Each time this die takes part in a combo you lose 5 health and the
      multiplier rises by +0.3. At 5 health or less the die adds no damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106561
    m_Localized: Loner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106562
    m_Localized: If this die is left out of the combo you play, it generates +2 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106563
    m_Localized: Party Animal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106564
    m_Localized: On an odd face this die deals triple damage. On an even face it
      deals none. It still counts toward forming the combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106565
    m_Localized: Streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106566
    m_Localized: "For each consecutive combo it takes part in this combat, it adds
      +3 more damage (+3, +6, +9\u2026). Resets if it's left out of a combo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106567
    m_Localized: Executioner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18332491591106568
    m_Localized: If this die takes part in a combo against an enemy at 25% health
      or less, it adds +12 damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18353398669819904
    m_Localized: Credit Card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18353398736928768
    m_Localized: 'Your gold can drop to -30: buy on credit and pay the debt back
      with what you earn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18353399701618688
    m_Localized: Straggler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18353399701618689
    m_Localized: 'On pickup it locks onto your least-used combo: that combo deals
      +50% damage for the rest of the run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18353400586616832
    m_Localized: Toll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18353400590811136
    m_Localized: When entering a regular combat room you may pay 15 + 10 per floor
      in gold to clear it without fighting. No loot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
